Employees can gain skills through three routes: 
1. Request Existing Skill (Workflow 1) 
o Prove you already have it 
o Manager approval required 
2. Complete Training (Workflows 5 & 6) 
o Enroll in training 
o Complete successfully 
o Skill automatically granted 
3. Project Assignment 
o Work on projects requiring specific skills 
o Gain experience 
o Later request skill addition with project as 